# labcommand_msgs/NameObject response, CDR little endian. Derived by hand from ros/labcommand_msgs/srv/NameObject.srv (protocol section 3.16). APPLIED, repeat_differs 0. Seven pad bytes align object_id.
00 01 00 00                 # encapsulation CDR_LE, options 0
00                       # pos 0    outcome APPLIED
00 00 00 00 00 00 00     # pos 1    pad to 8
07 00 00 00 00 00 00 00  # pos 8    object_id 7
01 00 00 00 00 00 00 00  # pos 16   revision 1
00                       # pos 24   repeat_differs 0
